+config TOUCHSCREEN_AXS15205
+	tristate "AXS15205 touch panel (MagicX Zero 40)"
+	depends on I2C && OF
+	default n
+	help
+	  AiXieSheng AXS15205 capacitive touch controller, as laminated to the
+	  MagicX Zero 40's 480x800 panel (twi1 address 0x3b, INT on PB6). A
+	  trimmed port of the vendor axs_ts driver: plain frame reads, type-B
+	  multitouch, no firmware download/upgrade or debug interfaces.
+
+	  oakMOSS builds it as a module (axs15205.ko) that the base does not
+	  autoload, like the XU20's Hynitron driver (tree patch 090): a touch
+	  probe built in runs on the kernel's init thread, where a stalled
+	  controller holds up the whole boot. The launcher loads it once the
+	  board has settled.
